Docker-based cybersecurity training lab for Raspberry Pi and Linux.

Instant Lab provides an interactive terminal menu for authorized security
training. It launches Parrot Security, Kali Linux, Nuclei, DVWA, OWASP Juice
Shop, bWAPP, ELK, and Wazuh.

To run in a terminal: instant-lab
To run from the menu: Menu -> Education -> Instant Lab

Docker Engine is required. Use only in an isolated lab against systems you own
or are authorized to test.
